  "exportNotes": "Ident bands (DECISIONS R87): every wire carries its circuit's code in Blue / Yellow / White bands (RNF-100, 6 mm) at every end - connector, terminal, splice and break - band 1 next to the end. Circuit per wire: Connections 'Ident' column and HARNESS-BUILD-LIST.csv. Wires 6 AWG and heavier carry no band. Labels: printed TMS-SCE marker at each connector bundle end (CSB3, OPTO8).",
